TEN 72V - 2 PIN còn tích hợp hệ thống bảo vệ pin điện tử có khả năng bảo vệ pin khỏi tình trạng quá tải, quá nhiệt và xả cạn hoàn toàn.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBáng cầm mềm được thiết kế chống trượt, vừa tạo cảm giác êm ái khi cầm vừa giúp thao tác điều khiển dễ dàng, linh hoạt và an toàn hơn. Chúng tôi luôn mong muốn làm hài lòng khách hàng từ giá đến chất lượng sản phẩm:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/15/0e/02/72deeb9df11a09e6fbc5b8de3cc6a314.jpeg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/15/0e/02/72deeb9df11a09e6fbc5b8de3cc6a314.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"undefined\" height=\"undefined\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b7/d0/18/d1f84bc8935b3ff8d9f0cf0726cddd72.jpeg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b7/d0/18/d1f84bc8935b3ff8d9f0cf0726cddd72.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"undefined\" height=\"undefined\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a2/68/90/8431db026875e6d70a3c0e16a71c02d5.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a2/68/90/8431db026875e6d70a3c0e16a71c02d5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"undefined\" height=\"undefined\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8c/db/dc/b0122c712a052f7a767a5ccca0119651.png\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8c/db/dc/b0122c712a052f7a767a5ccca0119651.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"undefined\" height=\"undefined\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1e/e5/7e/247be5f01a4947d58e403e634b446de4.png\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1e/e5/7e/247be5f01a4947d58e403e634b446de4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"undefined\" height=\"undefined\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/46/34/a4/e9583509f25c22dc9ac666a83f34da9f.jpeg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/46/34/a4/e9583509f25c22dc9ac666a83f34da9f.jpeg\" alt=